OL,3,CFilip Nowacki brings home the gold for
OL,4,CJersey at Commonwealth Games
OL,6,FFilip Nowacki has won gold in the
OL,7,FMen's 200m Breaststroke Final at the
OL,8,FCommonwealth Games, securing Jersey's
OL,9,Ffirst gold in 36 years.
OL,11,FIt makes him the most decorated Jersey
OL,12,Fathlete in Commonwealth Games history.
OL,14,FThe 18-year-old led the race from the
OL,15,Fstart and finished with a time of
OL,16,F2:07.87, followed by Canada's Oliver
OL,17,FDawson at 2:08.39, and Australia's Zac
OL,18,FStubblety-Cook at 2:08.91.
