OL,3,CFilip Nowacki brings home the gold for
OL,4,CJersey at Commonwealth Games
OL,6,FOn Sunday, Nowacki won silver in the
OL,7,F100m Breaststroke - which saw him beat
OL,8,Fthree-time Olympic champion Adam
OL,9,FRamsay-Peaty.
OL,11,FThe gold is the island's first since
OL,12,F1990, and the first ever in the pool.
OL,14,FIt comes after a hugely successful
OL,15,Fyear for the reigning double world
OL,16,Fjunior champion.
