OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F308A1785511110
OL,3,CFilip Nowacki brings home the gold for
OL,4,CJersey at Commonwealth Games
OL,6,FNowacki won the 100m and 200m
OL,7,Fbreaststroke titles at the 2025 World
OL,8,FJunior Championships and collected
OL,9,Ffour gold medals at the European
OL,10,FJunior Championships.
OL,12,FHe also won multiple gold medals while
OL,13,Frepresenting Jersey at the 2025 Island
OL,14,FGames in Orkney.
OL,16,FIn April, he claimed his first senior
OL,17,FBritish title by winning the 200m
OL,18,Fbreaststroke in 2:08.52.
